<title>USA: ENCAD expands agreement with Xerox.</title>
<headline>ENCAD expands agreement with Xerox.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ENCAD Inc said it was expanding its agreement with Xerox' ColorgrafX Systems unit.</p>
<p>Under the new agreement, ENCAD said it will supply the 50-inch VivagrafX XL 50 printer and associated supplies to ColorgrafX in order to broaden its product offering into the high-end wider format graphic arts applications.</p>
<p>The original agreement called for ENCAD to supply its 36-inch printer.</p>
</text>
